          return
        UNKNOWN PROCEDURE EXPERIMENTAL_PROCEDURE
        IF IFIF ELSE WHILE DO BREAK CONTINUE
        SWITCH CASE DEFAULT INITIALIZER case
          "unexpected " sb.wrap
            opName sb.appendStr
            " in " sb.appendS
            blockType sb.appendBlockType
            "-block" sb.appendS
